.justdesserts.global\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.justdesserts.global\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.justdesserts.global\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIG0oTCMHPrLDHkJcDFZdanQkdEZckpfoBDAoKCAASBgoCdGgQAboCOQodChdjb20uanVzdGRlc3NlcnRzLmdsb2JhbBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Step into the enchanting town of Frostvale, where sweetness masks dark secrets! Join talented pastry chef Ella as she returns to her hometown to uncover the truth behind a mysterious fire. Merge desserts to restore your family’s beloved pastry shop and dig past the icing to reveal long-buried truths.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMake Desserts\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge ingredients like powdered sugar and butter to whip up delicious cookies! Upgrade your recipes to unlock exquisite delights, including the elegant Swan Cake. The more you create, the more delectable treats you\\u0026#39;ll discover!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRebuild the Pastry Shop\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTransform your family’s charred shop into a magnificent dream space! Choose vintage tiles, glowing neon signs, and exquisite furniture to design a shop that reflects your style. Each area you rebuild unveils new plot clues.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReconnect with the Past\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReunite with Edward, your former lover. Is he your unexpected savior or an accomplice to the arson? As rivals appear, what schemes lie behind their charming smiles? Explore your mother’s mysterious recipe and the secrets of that fateful night!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUncover the Truth\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGather clues from the night of the fire through decorating and merging! Piece together charred photographs, shattered ledgers, and cryptic notes. Can you unravel the family secret that someone is desperate to keep hidden?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWarning: In this small town, the sweetest smiles often hide the deadliest lies.\"],\"Century Games Innovation Pte. Ltd.\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LrS9usanUwoVuvA4gHc-r2VRH5UWJfy7g0O2k6eTnnBKk-Ti5xHnzGZlwFUPNjYAXC-wFTuP1i1B3CYD7skCojg\"],null,[141,110,114,255]],null,[\"ประเภท 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eดูข้อมูลเพิ่มเติม\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"เหมาะสมสำหรับทุกกลุ่มอายุ มีความรุนแรงได้เล็กน้อยในบริบทที่ตลกขบขันหรือแฟนตาซี ห้ามไม่ให้มีภาษาที่หยาบคาย\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"THB\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"ซื้อ\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.justdesserts.global\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.justdesserts.global\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"ติดตั้ง\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"฿35.00 - ฿3,700.00 ต่อรายการ\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"เล่นฆ่าเวลา\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.liteorange.hometopia\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DNlTlOWp5zc9Xe77eizL8vU7aT72_SwVwSHcz0NtSlMz6Dmosk8BM_PDv3h2Zd661HVX9gK2klsySgKmaGoiUJk\"],null,[145,186,242,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aWQarOpCPESeAsLj1xVfRsU7LZJh9ka-WQOCQo8CaJhfYz89nuGR1AUzHB17FnMTLw0WFf3siKhysVwPh3s6\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lxB9LgGwwx8eJCeqimCIOHSAc_W5foOIoKgZolc1TSIbs0qp8vunjXkkoPytlUC-r9xcetIu6vjmXKyJTFHYuA\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3pd4sXVRwJ5tK-wNGMWYivdgdYWbxL-9A7Sc0bQSmHEu3vis8jM0IK7RtfGrm5yxAoCdWXd8QbNkl8vAnRvM\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MDKHx1Qj5PECJUvVlqU8L6kCTeFIKPIlxNFlImTQRn2z30JacNUs_zU5sz-WDJAwX8gV_kwia5jRvKdW8NPLHA\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/i5bxaH2Xfz1Vi9WuNDECSYTVIU-vPRhJ6KNH-AXzW__QEY2HCydPIZhkXsAqM_CFpnH0G8h6p_eINdp1JTbpbT4\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gndFMzlL0YOXUFXhvORbdETmiuf44XI-W6YwcrSaTWaWXnpyM2GYsmjKuDg8NEa5zctGvDHxKwIazfaw0fis\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rmuP3GK0b0mfdbK0Sit4CMqduRwSz6VUXKv3d0uXXD2mhP132Vyx7aPKBppIEKed5Q1GobU7CmgyFfeBSRHH2A\"]]],\"Frost Valley™: Merge \\u0026 Story\",[\"4.8\",4.7635136],\"เล่นฆ่าเวลา\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"THB\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"ซื้อ\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.liteorange.hometopia\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.liteorange.hometopia\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.liteorange.hometopia\"]],[\"qgJlGmMIHEoTCMHPrLDHkJcDFZdanQkdEZckpfoBDAoKCAASBgoCdGgQAboCOgoeChhjb20ubGl0ZW9yYW5nZS5ob21ldG9waWEQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Frost Valley: Merge \\u0026amp; Story—a cozy place recovering from a long, chilly winter.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe frost may have slowed things down, but with a little help, warmth and color are ready to return.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge items, follow story steps, and enjoy watching each frozen corner feel alive again.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAlong the way, you’ll meet friends who are starting over and happy to have your help.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge to Discover\\u003cbr\\u003eTap, drag, and merge to uncover bigger, better, and more exciting items.\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect merged items to advance chapters, unlock new scenes, and restore each space step by step.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRestore to Revive\\u003cbr\\u003eFix up frosty homes and make each space feel warm and welcoming again.\\u003cbr\\u003eEach repair opens new rooms and scenes, gently showing the valley coming back to life.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay to Reward\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin cozy in-game events with new characters, festive themes, and fun little stories.\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect special rewards that add fun surprises and new moments to enjoy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart your journey today and help Frost Valley find its warmth again—one merge at a time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://www.liteorange.co/ps.html\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://www.liteorange.co/terms.html\"],\"Tuyoo Games (HK) Limited\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nxjFTKu2zkGda6GGffv2Fa_2HREVW6m3EkpHszyPQhglvZww9-g0zi4T7vj2I4dSnIzZsu__ZLomxM71bo5IxA\"],null,[196,210,216,255]],null,[\"ประเภท 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"ภาษาหยาบคายที่ไม่รุนแรง\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eดูข้อมูลเพิ่มเติม\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7O