ull,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fq3hHZPxJe7acv05X9hZY0dlEuJm4As7xtZsa0zQN-fN_Os3SbnpzBbO_Aiubha1K8ojR9Cn4qhaAYIhedsgUw\"]]],\"Matching Story - Puzzle Games\",[\"4.9\",4.8975263],\"เล่นฆ่าเวลา\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"THB\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"ซื้อ\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.joycastle.mergematch\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.joycastle.mergematch\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.joycastle.mergematch\"]],[\"qgJlGmMIKkoTCMHPrLDHkJcDFZdanQkdEZckpfoBDAoKCAASBgoCdGgQAboCOgoeChhjb20uam95Y2FzdGxlLm1lcmdlbWF0Y2gQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"IZf9w5koHBU\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:IZf9w5koHBU?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:IZf9w5koHBU\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezk6VM1Whx7XWBDiX-Avc36fsuIxUtuilI9g8FsKzJ_XaA-54hmZM33t5A33IRZ33dnBLgmMw6xrsG_hyb-uNMCIsv8fXRGzsELvuRo_tgdI9bIsGIcRFzv4t131HZd5uGz_2eNv1d2BmtSxdGdhygipciBNOpLEJxnjIVLmRpARbdHWowDnmnZ7WZ4K94tLkQ3xxYW1Ucm71u70BqII4Bwsp8kbi3Q7C-bEUtE1MkuGTbwhLhKlcL30SueBe6B1ldof5ygIvdk3FSFC5TR5U9QYZLstm9P-nlEIBUeFPSfFKw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IZf9w5koHBU/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Step into a magical world of FREE matching games and puzzle games, where match 3 games, story games, tile match, and relaxing puzzle experiences come together! 🌸📖 Experience the perfect blend of classic match mechanics, immersive story, and creative merge puzzle gameplay in one addictive adventure.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy one of the best FREE matching games and various puzzle games for adults designed for puzzle lovers! Whether you enjoy matching games for adults, or fun match games, this game delivers everything you love—classic match 3 games fun, rich story, and relaxing progression in one place. 💖 Inspired by popular casual merge and classic match-3 experiences, it brings a fresh take on free puzzle games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 FEATURES 🌟\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 Classic Match-3 Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e Experience the timeless fun of match 3 games and tile match puzzle games! Swap, match, and clear levels with satisfying effects and cleverly designed puzzle levels. Classic matching games meet modern creativity in one of the best free puzzle games!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 Powerful Boosters \\u0026amp; Rich Props\\u003cbr\\u003e Unlock a wide variety of exciting boosters and tools! Use bombs 💣, rockets 🚀, and special power-ups to clear difficult puzzle levels and create amazing combos. Strategic use of props makes every match game more fun and rewarding!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📖 Rich Storyline Adventure\\u003cbr\\u003e Follow an engaging story game filled with drama, mystery, and heartwarming moments. Each level you complete unlocks more of this immersive story puzzle game and deepens your adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌿 Merge \\u0026amp; Grow Your Kingdom\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy relaxing merge gameplay! Combine items, upgrade tools, and unlock new resources to expand your world. Merge your way through this creative puzzle adventure and grow your dream space! ✨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌸 Decorate Your Dream Garden\\u003cbr\\u003eUse rewards from puzzle games to decorate your kingdom and restore beautiful locations. Design, customize, and transform your land into a blooming paradise!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Story + Puzzle + Decoration\\u003cbr\\u003eClassic matching games are now combined with rich story games and creative decoration. Match, solve puzzle games, explore the story, and build your own world!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💡 Fun \\u0026amp; Relaxing for Everyone\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for casual players and fans of matching games for adults and puzzle games for adults. Relax, think, and enjoy stress-free gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Daily Rewards \\u0026amp; Events\\u003cbr\\u003eGet bonuses, rewards, and participate in fun limited-time challenges every day! Special seasonal events inspired by popular holiday trends and fun cartoon themes keep the experience fresh!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 HOW TO PLAY 🎮\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Swap and match 3 or more items in fun tile match puzzle games to clear them\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Complete objectives to advance the story in this engaging story game\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Enjoy classic match 3 games mechanics with new puzzle twists\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Use boosters and props to solve tricky puzzle games levels 💥\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Merge items to unlock upgrades and garden tools 🌿\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Collect resources and decorate your garden your way 🌸\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Unlock chapters and dive deeper into the story adventure 📚\\u003cbr\\u003eEasy to play, hard to put down—this is the ultimate match games and puzzle games experience!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💖 Looking for free puzzle games, matching games, relaxing match games, or immersive story games? This game combines everything into one perfect puzzle adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 Ideal for fans of adults matching, creative merging, and players who love combining puzzle games, story, and decoration.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚀 Start Your Matching Adventure Today!\\u003cbr\\u003eMatch, merge, and explore a rich story puzzle adventure while building your dream garden. ✨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Don’t wait—enter the world of matching games, match 3 games, and free puzzle games, experience the magic of story games, and create your own beautiful garden today! 🌷\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow our Facebook page so we can start a fantastic adventure together⬇️\\u003cbr\\u003e 🔗: https://www.facebook.com/MatchingStory\"],\"VERTEX GAMES PTE. LTD.\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_8QGr0I02WWpqvZF8-KZH0QZUDbK2HQgIwZ1fOl4dUfh8Nv7MCuvyJvk_KHQHlpd64LHIaOamn-OMzK1CMtwvg\"],null,[183,153,98,255]],null,[\"ประเภท 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"การซื้อในเกม\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eดูข้อมูลเพิ่มเติม\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"THB\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"ซื้อ\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.joycastle.mergematch\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.joycastle.mergematch\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"ติดตั้ง\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"฿33.00 - ฿4,100.00 ต่อรายการ\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"เล่นฆ่าเวลา\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.mybogames.mergetown\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LVZGKSOUTDIEhochIsiJqeRaj9dPWN0u2W6G4et0FMK99s_Mcd8eI5oPnTaaVwNsO7mzORAitq47fSTI9JNh\"],null,[126,72,63,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/F4vv2PPVQMSi2zAn9dQaMxGl9FOknNFe_Oquhvhn0QtfwLwbd8Q7GHYHKmuEeg5C_3zbEW40AhL9HdVMQrUVYew\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-razKiaAlJh0_dlTcVWNPv_OpL_pxUD8AR01EcSzCYDzU