003cbr\\u003eAs a young, rising star playing small roles and working as an extra, your journey in Hollywood has been challenging. But life is like a box of chocolates, you never know what you\\u0026#39;re going to get. Along with the news of the famous star Peter\\u0026#39;s passing, there is also the revelation of an undisclosed daughter, who happens to be you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom this moment on, your life takes a whirlwind of transformation. Alongside navigating the ever-watchful eyes of the media, you must also be on guard against the obstacles posed by your half-sister Rose, who you share a father with.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Easy to play, match 3 to beat addictive levels.\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Customize outfits for any occasion.\\u003cbr\\u003e■ 1,000s of outfits to choose from, including exclusive high-end dresses to stand out from the crowd.\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Simulate the drama of being a star and face all challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Romantic Hollywood encounters: choose a handsome partner.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready to start your Hollywood journey?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e▼Facebook▼\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/en.HollywoodCrush\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e▼Facebook Email▼\\u003cbr\\u003esupport.hollywood@matchrella.com\"],\"VoyagerOne IE\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZMzej88fVSqJ3TFxYuQTj2Jb3qCoY92Tr6MXaGCN0ik92Udvp6sWS1V0jxTjEx2J5Go0Gm7ByW9WgAnNabMVTaw\"],null,[246,238,230,255]],null,[\"ประเภท 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"การโต้ตอบกับผู้ใช้และการซื้อในเกม (รวมถึงรายการสุ่ม)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eดูข้อมูลเพิ่มเติม\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-